  id: S-12
  lines:
  - speaker: "G\xFCvercinci Selim"
    text: "Bu sabah \xFC\xE7 mektup geldi, \xFC\xE7\xFC de at\xF6lyeye."
  - speaker: "Lonca K\xE2tibi Nevin"
    text: "Kasaba soru sormaya ba\u015Flad\u0131 demek. G\xFCzel."
  - speaker: "G\xFCvercinci Selim"
    text: "Cevaplar\u0131 da \xE7\u0131rak m\u0131 yazacak?"
  - speaker: "Lonca K\xE2tibi Nevin"
    text: "Yazmayacak, i\u015Faretleyecek. M\xFCrekkep israf olmas\u0131n."
